@startuml robustness-uc10
title 图 2-12 UC-10 提交处方审核 · 鲁棒图

skinparam {
  DefaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
  DefaultFontSize 12
  shadowing false
  ArrowColor #2563EB
  BorderColor #94A3B8
}

object "医生\n（参与者）" as ACT <<actor>>
object "处方编辑页\nPrescriptionEditPage" as B_PRE <<boundary>>
object "PrescriptionAppService\n（处方应用服务）" as C_PRE <<control>>
object "PrescriptionStateMachine\n（处方状态机）" as C_SM <<control>>
object "DrugQueryPort\n（药品目录查询）" as C_DRUG <<control>>
object "Prescription\n（处方）" as E_PRE <<entity>>
object "PrescriptionItem\n（处方明细）" as E_ITEM <<entity>>
object "AuditLog\n（审计日志）" as E_AUDIT <<entity>>

ACT --> B_PRE : 1. 点击「提交审核」
B_PRE --> C_PRE : 2. submit(prescriptionId, version)
C_PRE --> E_PRE : 3. 加载并校验归属（doctorId）
C_PRE --> C_SM : 4. assertCanSubmit(status, items, version)
C_SM --> E_PRE : 5. 读取当前状态与版本
C_PRE --> E_ITEM : 6. 校验诊断非空、明细 1~5 条
C_PRE --> C_DRUG : 7. 校验药品均为启用状态
C_PRE --> E_PRE : 8. 状态改为待审核，记录提交时间
C_PRE --> E_AUDIT : 9. 写审计日志
C_PRE --> B_PRE : 10. 返回提交结果并通知药师队列

note right of C_SM
  合法迁移：DRAFT / REJECTED → PENDING_REVIEW；
  其它状态一律 409；
  状态更新语句带 status 与 version 条件。
end note
@enduml
